2026-05-26 02:03:16,920 - INFO - ops_string = ["# SpMax_L\n# Leading eigenvalue from Laplace matrix, captures a structural descriptor of the molecular graph.\n# Usefulness: Indicates molecular connectivity and branching, which relates to molecular stability and potential biodegradability.\n\n# J_Dz(e)\n# Balaban-like index from Barysz matrix weighted by Sanderson electronegativity.\n# Usefulness: Encodes the electronegativity along with the molecular structure, indicative of chemical reactivity.\n\n# nO\n# Number of oxygen atoms.\n# Usefulness: Oxygen is critical for biodegradation processes as a key reactant for catabolic pathways.\n\n# F03[C-O]\n# Frequency of C-O bonds at topological distance 3.\n# Usefulness: High frequency of C-O bonds could indicate functional groups capable of biodegradation.\n\n# SpMax_L × TI2_L (interaction_SpMax_Ti2)\n# Interaction between leading eigenvalue from Laplace matrix and second Mohar index.\n# Usefulness: Models complex interdependencies between molecular structure metrics for biodegradation.\n\n# sum_HDon_O\n# Sum of hydrogen bond donors (nHDon) and oxygen atoms (nO).\n# Usefulness: Quantifies the hydrogen bonding potential, which directly impacts molecular interactions in the environment.\n\n# ratio_C_N\n# Ratio of carbon percentage to nitrogen count.\n# Usefulness: Captures the balance between carbon and nitrogen, influencing microbial metabolism rates.\n\n# log_F03_CN\n# Log transformation of frequency of C-N bonds at distance 3 (F03[C-N]).\n# Usefulness: Reduces skewness and highlights relative differences in bond frequency important for classification.\n\n# spmax_a_b_ratio\n# Ratio of SpMax_B(m) to SpMax_A.\n# Usefulness: Normalizes the effect of the Burden and adjacency matrix's largest eigenvalues, capturing proportional relationships.\n\n# abs_Psi_i_1d\n# Absolute value of Psi_i_1d, the intrinsic state pseudoconnectivity index.\n# Usefulness: Accounts for molecular branching structure irrespective of sign.\n\n# rolling_mean_SM6_L\n# 3-sample rolling mean of SM6_L (Spectral moment of order 6 from Laplace matrix).\n# Usefulness: Smoothens values across samples to reduce the noise in local structural variations.\n\n# reciprocal_Ti2_L\n# Reciprocal transformation of TI2_L (Second Mohar index from Laplace matrix).\n# Usefulness: Captures inverse relationships for more nuanced patterns in molecular electronic distribution.\n\n# bin_C_percent\n# Binned categories for percentage of carbon atoms (C%).\n# Usefulness: Encodes high-level categorical information simplifying the analysis of organic content.\n\n# is_high_Cp\n# Binary flag indicating if nCp (number of terminal primary C) is greater than 2.\n# Usefulness: Highlights molecules with significant terminal carbon presence.\n\n# cross_nHDon_F03_CO\n# Cross feature of H-bond donors (nHDon) and frequency of C-O bonds at distance 3 (F03[C-O]).\n# Usefulness: Models joint impact of hydrogen bonding and oxygen bond frequencies critical to biodegradation.\n\ndf.drop(columns=['J_Dz(e)', 'nO'], inplace=True)"]
